<heading>add - Create a new topic in a category.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  add NAME --category CATEGORY
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Creates a new topic inside the given category. CATEGORY may be
an id or a category name. Topic names are unique within their
category; the same topic name may exist in different categories.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
add "Roman Empire" --category History
  Create the topic Roman Empire in the category History.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
edit, delete, list, find
</paragraph>
